          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Now slowly move the object away from the mirrors (Fig. 10.5b). What changes do you see in the images in both the mirrors? Do the images become smaller or larger? Do they continue to be erect? Again, note down your observations."
            }
          ]
        },
